.DS_Store

# Workspace-private dirs (NEVER commit to public repos)
.career-os/
.cyborg/
.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
.agents/
.codex/
.superset/
WIP/
INPUT/
# Handoff DOCUMENTS, by name. Do NOT use a `*handoff*` wildcard here: this repo
# vendors plugin source under engines/, and that pattern silently excluded
# co-dialectic's `hooks/precompact-handoff.ts` AND its entire `skills/handoff/`
# skill from every published package. hooks.json referenced a file that was
# never shipped, so the PreCompact hook failed silently on every install.
# Match handoff docs by filename; never by substring. (XOS-251)
NEXT_SESSION_HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF.md
handoff.md

# Secrets
.env
.env.local
*.secret
*.key

# Generated / OS
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.log

# Career OS session-logger contamination (added 2026-05-18)
# This is NOT a Career OS workspace; the session-logger hook (v0.66+)
# has a workspace-identity gate that prevents this from happening again,
# but this .gitignore is defense-in-depth in case the gate is bypassed.
brain/sessions/
